@baseUrl = https://localhost:5001
@studentId = 2
@examId = 1

### Calculate result
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/results/calculate
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "studentId": {{studentId}},
  "examId": {{examId}}
}

### Get one student's result for an exam
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/results/student/{{studentId}}/exam/{{examId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get all exam results for a student
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/results/student/{{studentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get student backlogs
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/results/student/{{studentId}}/backlogs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
